WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Know when to walk away.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.100
Danger signs.

3
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.900
A weapon or an object that could be one.

4
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.500
Threats against you.

5
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:11.700
A group closing round you.

6
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.300
Pushing or hitting.

7
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Or you're on your own.

8
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:21.300
Then step back - still facing them - and get at least three metres.

9
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.900
Keep watching from a safe place.

10
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.100
Radio: Disturbance, or Security Assistance.

11
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:29.500
Then let Security or the police take over.

12
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.900
Getting nowhere?

13
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:38.900
Use an exit line - 'Let me check that with my supervisor' - and pass it on.

